## 💻 DSA Practice

### Reverse String

```java
class Solution {

    public void reverseString(char[] s) {

        int left = 0;
        int right = s.length - 1;

        while (left < right) {

            char temp = s[left];
            s[left] = s[right];
            s[right] = temp;

            left++;
            right--;
        }
    }
}
```

### Palindrome

```java
class Solution {

    public boolean isPalindrome(String s) {

        int left = 0;
        int right = s.length() - 1;

        while (left < right) {

            if (s.charAt(left) != s.charAt(right)) {
                return false;
            }

            left++;
            right--;
        }

        return true;
    }
}
```

### Complexity

```text
Time  : O(n)
Space : O(1)
```

